# UltraKill Yourself UI localization
#
# The file name MUST stay en_US / ru_RU, not en_us / ru_ru, even though 1.12.2
# resource paths are otherwise lowercase. A mod ships no pack.mcmeta of its own, so
# Forge treats its resource pack as format 2 and wraps it in LegacyV2Adapter — and
# that adapter rewrites every request for lang/xx_yy.lang into lang/xx_YY.lang before
# it reaches the pack. Lowercase names are simply never asked for: the file loads for
# nothing, every uky.* key falls through to its own name, and the interface fills up
# with raw keys while vanilla strings keep working.
#
# Vanilla keys (menu.singleplayer, options.title, ...) are reused where they exist;
# only strings that vanilla hardcodes, or that are ours, need an entry here.
